  "objective": "新增只读审计工具，扫描现有 WorkerTaskPack 文件，报告 acceptance_profile 迁移准备度，并识别需要人工处理的命令。",
  "required_reading": [
    "docs/CURRENT_ARCHITECTURE_INDEX.md",
    "docs/AI_COMPILATION_SYSTEM_V0_1.md",
